## Decisions

### DL-01 — Registration shell mode

| Field | Value |
| ----- | ----- |
| **Status** | **PENDING SIGN-OFF** |
| **Context** | P6-3 conversion focus; SMK-PTL-06; PCMS-REG-01 resume on register page only. |
| **Decision** | Minimal shell on `/catalog/{tourId}/register`; full shell on all `/me/*`. Registration excluded from member registry. |
| **Consequences** | Registration never shows bottom nav; graduation to full shell at `/me/*`. |
| **Dependencies** | PCMS-REG-01; §9 registration policy |
| **Open questions** | None — closed in blueprint. |

### DL-02 — Hub / Profile placement (Denali reference IA)

| Field | Value |
| ----- | ----- |
| **Status** | **PENDING SIGN-OFF** |
| **Context** | Five touch targets; profile is not a daily-switch tab. |
| **Decision** | Bottom nav: Home · Trips · Wallet · Membership · More. Profile in user menu only. |
| **Consequences** | Denali reference binding; other workspaces may differ within cap rules. |
| **Dependencies** | DL-04; §22 Denali reference |
| **Open questions** | Per-workspace IA override rules beyond Denali. |

### DL-03 — Trips route naming

| Field | Value |
| ----- | ----- |
| **Status** | **PENDING SIGN-OFF** |
| **Context** | Avoids WRS confusion with marketing `/tours`; SMK-PTL backward compatibility. |
| **Decision** | Registry module id `trips`; route `/me/registrations` retained as permanent alias. |
| **Consequences** | SMK-PTL-02/04/05 keep `/me/registrations` href; label uses trips semantics. |
| **Dependencies** | DL-06; WRS-PATH-01/02; URL freeze §48 |
| **Open questions** | None. |

