| Field | Value |
| ----- | ----- |
| **Status** | **PENDING SIGN-OFF** |
| **Context** | Mirrors `validateSettingsManifest` strictness. |
| **Decision** | Codegen hard fail if >5 primary tier modules declared. |
| **Consequences** | Forces explicit secondary/hidden tiering. |
| **Dependencies** | Operator settings registry pattern |
| **Open questions** | None. |

