### DL-12 — returnUrl / portalReturn contract

| Field | Value |
| ----- | ----- |
| **Status** | **IMPLEMENTED (subset — 2026-07-14)** · **EXTENDED by DL-40 (design)** |
| **Context** | MAP §3.6 intent; prevents open redirect. |
| **Decision** | Query `portalReturn` on portal `/login` egress; safe relative paths only (`isSafePortalReturnPath` — leading `/`, no `//`). Targets: `/me/*`, `/catalog/{tourId}/register`. Register-host login uses same-page modal + `?auth=login` (no `portalReturn` hop). |
| **Consequences** | `completeMemberLoginEgress()` resolves query → `data-portal-return` → default module on **login host**. Login never enters tour intake. |
| **Dependencies** | PCMS §5.0 PCMS-UX-01..04 · MODAL; `packages/catalog-registration-flow-ui/src/read-portal-return.ts` |
| **Open questions** | Strict prefix allowlist (marketing-only builders) deferred. |

### DL-40 — Member login modal presentation

| Field | Value |
| ----- | ----- |
| **Status** | **IMPLEMENTED (2026-07-16)** · **EXTENDED by DL-41 (2026-08-05)** |
| **Context** | Full-page `/login` alpine experience vs same-page auth for tour guests; marketing SSR must still detect portal members (PCMS-03-READ). |
| **Decision** | Portal-hosted login **modal** (desktop dialog · mobile bottom sheet). Thin `/login` retained for `/me/*` middleware gate. Tour registration stays full-page. Marketing tour «ورود» → `/catalog/{id}/register?auth=login`. Header Sign in → `/login?portalReturn=/me/registrations`. Every modal success path runs cookie probe (PCMS-UX-MODAL-COOKIE); cross-surface marketing header requires **custom apex** cookie Domain (PCMS-COOK-01/03) — not `Domain=.localhost`. |
| **Consequences** | Shared `PortalLoginModalProvider` + `PortalMemberLoginFlow`; GSH URL builder change for registration login; Denali modal CSS hooks; SMK-PTL-10. |
| **Dependencies** | PCMS-001 §5.0 · [portal-member-login-modal.mdoc](../portal-member-login-modal.mdoc) · DL-12 |
| **Open questions** | Backdrop-click dismiss; optional `?auth=login` on portal home. |

### DL-41 — Modal-first tour registration auth

| Field | Value |
| ----- | ----- |
| **Status** | **IMPLEMENTED (2026-08-05)** — modal-first guest register + Denali skin for gate/modal body |
| **Context** | Dual guest paths (inline phone→OTP on register **and** optional login modal) split auth UX; product wants one OTP path and intake-only register page. |
| **Decision** | **PCMS-UX-MODAL-04:** Guest `/catalog/{id}/register` auto-opens login modal; page must not render inline auth steps. New member profile: display name required, email optional (existing `register-complete`). Session members unchanged (PCMS-REG-01 intake-only). Denali CSS: `login-page.css` gate hooks + `denali-form-controls.css` scopes `[data-portal-login-modal-body]`. |
| **Consequences** | Register page gates on `buildRegistrationResumeInitialState`; guest auth gate + `PortalLoginModalOpener`; reopen via `PortalRegisterSignInLink`; client session probe may reload when SSR missed cookie (custom apex). Specs assert no guest `PublicCatalogRegistrationFlow` without resume. **`/login` presentation superseded by DL-48:** page OTP (`data-portal-login-full-page`), not `data-portal-login-thin-host` and not auto-open `host="login"`. |
| **Dependencies** | DL-40 · PCMS §5.0 · [portal-member-login-modal.mdoc](../portal-member-login-modal.mdoc) |
| **Open questions** | Optional backdrop-click dismiss. |
| **Verify (2026-08-05 local)** | Guest register HTML: `data-portal-register-guest-auth=modal-first` + gate + modal, no inline phone. BFF: new mobile → profile → `register-complete` sets `atour_mb_session` `Domain=denali.localhost`; returning member → session without profile. Host: use `portal.denali.localhost:3003` (not bare localhost). |

