### DL-18 — L4 enforcement strictness

| Field | Value |
| ----- | ----- |
| **Status** | **SUPERSEDED** (2026-07-06) — unified member portal contract |
| **Context** | OQ-02 closed in blueprint. Prior phased warn/fail + Urban/starter exempt model contradicted runtime fail-closed. |
| **Decision (superseded)** | ~~Phase 2: codegen warn if L3 declares `memberPortal`. Phase 5: CI fail if Denali lacks block. Urban/starter exempt.~~ |
| **Replacement** | `memberPortal.availability` (`off` \| `minimal` \| `full`) is SSOT. L4 requires `guestConformance.memberApp: true` **and** availability ≠ `off`. Urban/guest-club use `minimal` (not exempt). Enforcement: `guard-member-portal-contract.mjs` + generated `WORKSPACE_MEMBER_PORTAL_CONTRACTS`. |
| **Consequences** | No workspace is exempt from declaring availability; trunk workspaces pinned to `minimal`, Denali to `full`. |
| **Dependencies** | DL-07; [member-portal-registry-schema.mdoc](./member-portal-registry-schema.mdoc) §6 |
| **Open questions** | None. |

