### DL-43 — Profile Discard vs avatar side-effect

| Field | Value |
| ----- | ----- |
| **Status** | **PENDING SIGN-OFF** |
| **Context** | Avatar upload/remove commits immediately via `/api/me/avatar`; text fields commit only on PATCH. Form Discard previously risked resetting avatar preview to a stale `profile.fields.avatarUrl`. |
| **Decision** | Discard resets only PATCH-editable field values and form-level messages. Avatar client state tracks the last successful server URL (INV-MP-AVATAR-01). Discard is not “undo server avatar”. |
| **Consequences** | Reload after Discard still shows server avatar; no new undo API. |
| **Dependencies** | [platform-portal-member-profile.mdoc](../platform-portal-member-profile.mdoc) INV-MP-AVATAR-01 · INV-MP-CACHE-01 |
| **Open questions** | None. |

